      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-3634-3966"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3637-3667"><rb>治脩公</rb><rt>ちしうこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3667-3676">これを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3676-3697"><rb>御覽</rb><rt>ごらん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3697-3703">じ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3703-3718"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3718-3724">はず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3724-3745"><rb>莞爾</rb><rt>につこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3745-3751">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3751-3772"><rb>打笑</rb><rt>うちゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3772-3775">み</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3775-3790"><rb>給</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3790-3796">ふ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3796-3811"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3811-3814">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3814-3838"><rb>炊烟</rb><rt>すゐえん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3838-3871"><rb>數千流</rb><rt>すうせんりう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3871-3874">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3874-3898"><rb>爾時</rb><rt>そのとき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3898-3913"><rb>公</rb><rt>こう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3913-3916">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3916-3937"><rb>左右</rb><rt>さいう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3937-3940">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3940-3958"><rb>顧</rb><rt>かへり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3958-3966">み、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-3966-4112"><seg source="#source-3966-3969">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3969-3981"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3981-3984">よ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3984-3996"><rb>我</rb><rt>わ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3996-3999">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3999-4023"><rb>黽勉</rb><rt>びんべん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4023-4026">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4026-4041"><rb>民</rb><rt>たみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4041-4044">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4044-4059"><rb>他</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4059-4068">よりも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4068-4086"><rb>命</rb><rt>いのち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4086-4101"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby>し。」</p>
